  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Farmer Vulnerability Reduction Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Grant is to provide immediate and urgent assistance to at least 1100 small farmers in Grenada to cope with therecent global financial and food crisis and weather fluctuations through the provision of incentives for purchasing improved agriculture inputcomma water management technologycomma and adoption of improved livestock practices.</narrative>
  </description>
